This repository contains operator source extracted from submission ZIPs belonging to
the jiaqian CANNBench solution. Each operator and common scaffold records the
exact source Job, original ZIP SHA-256, and published file SHA-256 hashes.

Common build scaffold and files carrying Huawei copyright notices derive from
the CANNBench project and its submission templates. Their notices have been
retained. The CANN Open Software License Agreement Version 2.0 is included as
LICENSE. Official evaluator code, Golden implementations, hidden cases, and
private run evidence are not included.
